@*
    _Icons.cshtml — inline SVG icon sprite.

    Rendered ONCE per page inside <body>, invisible. Every icon on the page
    references a symbol here via <svg class="icon"><use href="#icon-name"/></svg>.

    Icons are traced by hand from Lucide (MIT — https://lucide.dev). No external
    dependency; no CDN; no font file. Adding a new icon = paste a new <symbol>.
*@
